              "url": "https://perso.univ-rennes1.fr/bachir.bekka/KazhdanTotal.pdf",
              "locator": "Chapter 1, §§1.1-1.4, printed pp. 31-55: Definition 1.1.1, Proposition 1.1.5, Theorem 1.1.6, Proposition 1.1.9, Proposition 1.2.1, Proposition 1.2.3, Theorem 1.2.5, Theorem 1.3.1, Theorem 1.3.4"
            },
