              "url": "https://www.math.utah.edu/pcmi12/lecture_notes/breuillard.pdf",
              "locator": "Lecture 2, §§II-III, printed pp. 3-8 (PDF pp. 9-14): almost invariant vectors, Kazhdan pairs, compact generation"
            },
            {
